  "title": "Frosted Chocolate Cookies",
  "description": "This was the most requested cookie for my late grandmother to make. It is a small drop cookie; one everyone will love. Spread my grandmother's Chocolate Frosting on this delicious cookies. The recipe can be found here on CookieRecipe.com!",
  "authors": [
    "Greg Pierce"
  ],
